+#### Push notifications (optional)
+
+To enable per-device push notifications in Notification Settings, provide the same VAPID key pair to both the web app and job workers:
+
+- `VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY` — the URL-safe Base64 public key (shared with browsers)
+- `VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY` — the URL-safe Base64 private key (keep this secret)
+
+Keep these keys stable across deployments; replacing them requires devices to subscribe again. Push delivery uses background jobs and requires HTTPS (localhost also works for development). The VAPID contact address uses `MAILER_FROM_ADDRESS`.
+
+People enable notifications separately for each device and account. Turning them off affects only that device's registration for the current account. On iOS, install Fizzy on the Home Screen first; notification settings include browser-specific help.
+
